          "description": "Given indices of missing cells, computes the polynomial that vanishes at every point corresponding to a missing field element. First builds a short vanishing polynomial over the reduced domain (CELLS_PER_EXT_BLOB roots of unity with bit-reversal), then extends it to the full domain by spacing coefficients FIELD_ELEMENTS_PER_CELL apart (exploiting the closed form of the vanishing polynomial over a coset).",
