              "id": "ST-014",
              "description": "Step 2: Compute vanishing polynomial Z(x) for missing cells."
            },
            {
              "id": "ST-015",
              "description": "Step 3: Compute E(x)*Z(x) in evaluation form via FFT, then inverse FFT to get coefficients."
            },
            {
              "id": "ST-016",
              "description": "Step 4: Convert both (P*Z)(x) and Z(x) to evaluations over a coset, divide pointwise, then inverse coset FFT to get P(x)."
            },
            {
